es":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9dW3CVyvnTXdkXg2AOyBfw","review_id":"W1xfbfzdjni66gax2Hj_9A","date":"2017-10-10T01:50:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9103697538375854,"text_excerpt":"I am so excited to have a coffee shop in the neighborhood! I visited this gem for the first time a couple days after they opened. It is tucked away next to the community center. I met the owner, Courtney and she is incredibly sweet and friendly. They sell French Truck Coffee, which is delicious and they have a selection of pastries, including some vegan and gluten free goodies. There is plenty of space to sit and relax and I will definitely be back."},{"business_id":"9dW3CVyvnTXdkXg2AOyBfw","review_id":"iFCFaBU7G7Fqn6kzm-DjDQ","date":"2017-12-11T16:40:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9050917625427246,"text_excerpt":"Birds Nest has it all! French truck coffee & Tea, Gracious Bakery pastries, Simon paintings on the walls and a play area for the kiddies. There is also a bunch of tables, inside and out, for getting work or studying done. I tried their breakfast burrito and it was delicious! It was like a panini wrap of goodness. The staff is super friendly too! The wifi password is on the bottom of your receipt. Warm and welcoming space!"},{"business_id":"9dW3CVyvnTXdkXg2AOyBfw","review_id":"xkmkRxvF1KS9hZGaY4be3g","date":"2021-02-11T20:26:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8992092609405518,"text_excerpt":"Because it was such lovely weather we walked through the park and found ourselves at Bird's nest cafe. First off, kudos to the staff. The lady who took our order was very helpful. We ordered a grilled cheese sandwich and she advised us that it might be a little too plain! She was right and I am grateful that she took the minute to warn us to temper our expectations! We also ordered the recommended lunch sandwich of the day, a tomato, pesto, mozzarella sandwich! Oh Yummm~! Both came with a bag of chips. You could choose which chip you wanted. Awesome! And they had Oatmilk latte, and whole milk for my partner. So we ordered one of each! On the whole, great location, great food, great servic..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9dW3CVyvnTXdkXg2AOyBfw","photo_id":"fa6Idjqys9s-JNxQV_t96w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fa6Idjqys9s-JNxQV_t96w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9580297470092773},{"business_id":"9dW3CVyvnTXdkXg2AOyBfw","photo_id":"z0GxEz_mwI9Nxl0-xqXNVQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/z0GxEz_mwI9Nxl0-xqXNVQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.958029568195343}]},"notebook_case":null}
